1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,160
These icons on the right hold all your settings.

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:12,490
Theme switches between dark and light.

3
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:19,210
You can make all the text bigger or smaller here.

4
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:22,970
Panels turns parts of the screen on and off.

5
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:29,680
Turn the news panel, the account bar or the chart's bottom bar on or off.

6
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:35,540
News Feeds is where you pick your news sources.

7
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,800
The gear icon opens the full settings window.

8
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:45,210
Account shows your ID, your currency and your time zone.

9
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:49,390
Scroll down to choose how money values are shown.

10
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:53,150
Security is where you change your password.

11
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:57,810
It tells you exactly what the new password needs.

12
00:00:57,910 --> 00:01:01,580
Diagnostics sends a report to support if something goes wrong.

13
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:07,000
You can send it to the server, save it, or e-mail it.

14
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:12,670
Trading is the biggest page. Start with your order size.

15
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:16,830
Keep scrolling for notifications, sounds and more.

16
00:01:16,930 --> 00:01:20,590
Session shows your current login.

17
00:01:20,690 --> 00:01:25,350
Log Out is here when you are finished.

